                "entry_id": "9f2c4cfd-6f8e-354c-a3b9-0291c5c766c8",
                "word": "geestkracht",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2dcd6c45-0491-3caa-961d-d258ff49cb7d",
                        "entry_id": "9f2c4cfd-6f8e-354c-a3b9-0291c5c766c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "de mentale en psychologische instelling die nodig is om iets te doen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1968d89d-addc-4fbb-8e14-6aa7579de331",
                                "sense_id": "2dcd6c45-0491-3caa-961d-d258ff49cb7d",
                                "text": "In oktober 2001 begon pastoor B. Wolters vol geestkracht aan zijn taak als pastoor van de parochies Heeten en Nieuw Heeten/Holten. Geen moment had hij toen verwacht dat hij ruim zeven jaar later al met emeritaat zou gaan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cdc6d32-d71b-4b36-89ed-6abb3c1e41fa",
                                "sense_id": "2dcd6c45-0491-3caa-961d-d258ff49cb7d",
                                "text": "\"Iedereen is trots op u\", zei de president, volgens de woordvoerder. De overwinning van Landis getuigde van \"grote moed\", vertelde de president verder aan Landis. \"U hebt een formidabele geestkracht getoond\". George W. Bush nodigde de familie Landis ook uit naar het Witte Huis."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "32768fb9-5e68-4f66-93bf-7d94674e13ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "9f2c4cfd-6f8e-354c-a3b9-0291c5c766c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2dcd6c45-0491-3caa-961d-d258ff49cb7d",
                        "target_lang_word": "will-power",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "will-power",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9ef1812-8055-35e6-82f4-480340f97cac",
                                        "entry_id": "cee9c68f-202d-3e3d-b334-281f77ed9b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of willpower."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d4fbdd3-ebf9-4b03-9d64-fc276f0ea54a",
                                                "sense_id": "b9ef1812-8055-35e6-82f4-480340f97cac",
                                                "text": "At the centre of Stalin’s superiority over his competitors was certainly his intense will, just as Napoleon ranked what he called ‘moral fortitude’ higher in a general than genius or experience. When Milovan Djilas said to Stalin during the Yugoslav-Soviet discussions in Moscow during the war that the Serbian politician Gavrilović was ‘a shrewd man’, Stalin commented, as though to himself: ‘Yes, there are politicians who think shrewdness is the main thing in politics. . . .’⁴⁴ His was a will-power taken to a logical extreme. There is something non-human about his almost total lack of normal restraints upon it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ee04e55-0c60-4f02-bd7f-48559ac77c87",
                                                "sense_id": "b9ef1812-8055-35e6-82f4-480340f97cac",
                                                "text": "Mantrams: My power of resistance is growing from moment to moment.\nMy will-power is growing from moment to moment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
